      "id": "sort_groups",
      "evidence_type": "official_artifact_static_observation",
      "conclusion": "Aggregated non-priority branch preserves pinned and custom sections. Chronological then uses dcj.k in ife.j date/group helper. ByProject renders project headers/rows with project-name host disambiguation and remaining recents. Priority renders priority header/list from dcj.l, then ife.j over dcj.m. dcj.l flattens each host t7m.i and applies comparator chain; dcj.m flattens t7m.j and applies distinct comparator chain. dcj.k flattens t7m.h and applies its comparator. These are distinct state collections, not one generic list renamed three ways.",
